 "remarks": "An exceptional rental opportunity in the heart of Cos Cob. Built in 2017, this refined 3-bedroom, 2.5-bath residence offers approx. 2,500 sq ft across three thoughtfully designed levels, complemented by a 1-car garage and parking for 3.  The lower level opens to a finished foyer with a den/office and closet. Ascend to the main level's gracious foyer, appointed with a generous walk-in closet, powder room, and a second office/gym with its own closet. The family room is anchored by a gas fireplace with sliders to a private stone patio, flowing seamlessly into a kitchen with stainless steel appliances and a center island. Formal dining and living rooms complete the level, each finished with elegant crown molding that frames every room like a well-tailored suit.  Upstairs, the primary suite is a true retreat, featuring a spacious walk-in closet and a luxurious bath with jacuzzi tub and double vanity. Two additional generously proportioned bedrooms, one with a walk-up attic for storage, and a dedicated upper-level laundry room with sink add everyday ease. Hardwood floors on the main and upper levels, luxury vinyl plank on the lower level, tile in the baths.",
